Tab Statistics
Tab Statistics [Exporter]
The tab Statistics shows the most important statistical data.
Remarks
The tab shows the values for the services and for the Exporter. For each of these blocks, adding up the
individual values results in a value 100 percent.
Note
To show the statistics values for the services in a Chart, drag the Exporter over a Chart and drop it there.
To show the statistics values for the Services and for the Exporter in a Chart, hold down Shift, drag the
Exporter over a Chart and drop it there.
To collect the failure times of the services and of the Exporter, select the check box Fail Services.
Shift Calendar [Exporter]
11-3286 Plant Simulation Help
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

To only collect the failure times of the Exporter, clear the check box Fail Services.
To collect Exporter statistics data, select the check box Exporter Statistics 
 .
The Exporter only collects failed times that accrue during the processing and setup time, i.e., times that
are located outside of the paused and of the unplanned time.
Waiting times only accrue during the times when the Exporter is available, i.e., when these times are
located outside of the paused, the unplanned, and the failed times.
Note
The Exporter stays at the station, to which he is brokered, while this station is failed, paused, or
stopped. Statistics does not count this time as waiting.
