Importers [Exporter]
Opens a table, which shows all importers for which the Exporter provides services.
Remarks
The table shows the path to and the names of the Importers and their Type: The Type 0 designates the
failure-importer, 1 the set-up-importer, 2 the processing-importer, and 3 the transport-importer.
See also
findNewImporter [SimTalk]
getImporters [SimTalk]
Importers [Exporter]
Plant Simulation Help 11-3293
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

Exported Services [Exporter]
Opens a table, which shows the names of all services which the Exporter exports at this time.
Remarks
Double-click the name of a service to open a subtable.
The subtable shows the name of the Importer, its Type (0 designates the failure-importer, 1 the set-up-
importer, 2 the processing-importer, and 3 the transport-importer) and the Amount of services provided.
Instead, you can also right-click the Exporter and select Show Exported Services on the context menu in
the Frame.
See also
getExportedServices [SimTalk]
